{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Planternauts",
    "steam_appid": 3125700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, humanity embarks on a project to terraform distant planets and make them habitable. You are a member of the team of specialists in greening and ecosystem adaptation. Your task is to find rare plants, clean up the environment, and prepare it for vegetation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet you have arrived on is harsh and inhospitable. You will gather local flora samples and use them to turn this barren wasteland into a green oasis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration of Uncharted Territories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into vast locations, explore rocky wastelands, and find rare plant specimens crucial for greening the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection and Cleansing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather as many plant samples as possible, cleanse the areas from pollutants, and prepare them for subsequent greening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terraforming Technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use advanced technologies to adapt and cultivate plants, transforming barren lands into flourishing gardens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a lifeless planet into a green paradise?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, humanity embarks on a project to terraform distant planets and make them habitable. You are a member of the team of specialists in greening and ecosystem adaptation. Your task is to find rare plants, clean up the environment, and prepare it for vegetation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet you have arrived on is harsh and inhospitable. You will gather local flora samples and use them to turn this barren wasteland into a green oasis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration of Uncharted Territories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into vast locations, explore rocky wastelands, and find rare plant specimens crucial for greening the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection and Cleansing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather as many plant samples as possible, cleanse the areas from pollutants, and prepare them for subsequent greening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terraforming Technologies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use advanced technologies to adapt and cultivate plants, transforming barren lands into flourishing gardens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a lifeless planet into a green paradise?</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Planternauts \u2013 an immersive adventure in planetary terraforming where you play as a brave explorer tasked with greening barren landscapes. Explore, discover, and transform an alien world into a lush paradise by initiating a grand project to create a new ecosystem.",
